WEBVTT

00:00:20.303 --> 00:00:22.098
All right. Hey, hey, no, no! No.

00:00:22.342 --> 00:00:24.392
Hey. Hey, please.

00:00:24.996 --> 00:00:27.747
Kevin, Jerry, watch the girls
for me, okay?

00:00:28.163 --> 00:00:31.274
Dave, Stuart, come this way!
With me! Come on!

00:00:34.297 --> 00:00:36.321
-Come on!
- Mmm-mmm!

00:00:39.779 --> 00:00:41.243
(DOOR CLOSES)
(SINGING RESUMES)

00:00:45.080 --> 00:00:47.207
(WHOOPING AND LAUGHING)

00:00:49.125 --> 00:00:50.168
(SINGING LULLABY)

00:01:02.929 --> 00:01:03.983
(BOTH SIGH)

00:01:04.951 --> 00:01:06.119
(SPEAKING MIONIONESE)

00:01:06.482 --> 00:01:07.519
Oh! (CHUCKLING)

00:01:08.338 --> 00:01:09.479
(CHATTERING IN MINIONESE)

00:01:10.243 --> 00:01:11.357
Mmm-hmm.

00:01:11.795 --> 00:01:13.233
(COUNTING IN MINIONESE)

00:01:13.808 --> 00:01:14.881
(CHUCKLING)

00:01:15.088 --> 00:01:16.601
(GRUNTS) Huh?

00:01:20.323 --> 00:01:21.533
(SHUDDERING)

00:01:21.846 --> 00:01:23.702
-Oca!
-Oca!

00:01:28.498 --> 00:01:29.624
(YELPS)

00:01:34.921 --> 00:01:36.006
(SCREAMS)

00:01:37.045 --> 00:01:38.127
(MEOWS)

00:01:39.824 --> 00:01:41.935
(CHUCKLING)
Looka too! (YELLS)

00:01:46.933 --> 00:01:47.976
Huh?

00:01:49.519 --> 00:01:50.604
(YELLS)

00:01:58.236 --> 00:01:59.279
(YOWLING)

00:01:59.779 --> 00:02:00.822
(YELLING)

00:02:05.285 --> 00:02:06.369
(MEOWS)

00:02:08.830 --> 00:02:12.417
(SINGING AND WHISTLING JOYFULLY)

00:02:18.089 --> 00:02:21.843
(HIP HOP PLAYING ON HEADPHONES)

00:02:28.539 --> 00:02:31.267
We're stealth ninjas. We make no sound.

00:02:31.968 --> 00:02:33.405
Right. Gotcha.

00:02:34.862 --> 00:02:36.316
Ya! (SIGHS)

00:02:38.970 --> 00:02:41.372
All right, El Macho. You're going down.

00:02:41.606 --> 00:02:43.239
-Wait! Wait.
-What?

00:02:44.719 --> 00:02:45.951
What are you doing?

00:02:46.384 --> 00:02:48.578
I'm checking for
laser beam alarm triggers.

00:02:50.371 --> 00:02:51.466
It's a restaurant!

00:02:51.583 --> 00:02:52.749
You never know what kind of booby traps

00:02:52.874 --> 00:02:54.454
this guy could have set. Huh? Come on.

00:02:54.647 --> 00:02:56.836
There are no booby traps.

00:02:58.608 --> 00:02:59.965
Ha! Booby!

00:03:00.523 --> 00:03:02.240
(GASPS)
(CREAKING)

00:03:09.347 --> 00:03:10.450
(CLUCKS)

00:03:10.688 --> 00:03:12.149
Oh. There's a chicken.

00:03:12.894 --> 00:03:14.980
(GASPS) Are you lost, little guy?

00:03:15.665 --> 00:03:17.023
You must be lost.

00:03:17.460 --> 00:03:19.294
Ha! Some guard dog.

00:03:19.369 --> 00:03:20.402
(SCREAMS)

00:03:23.488 --> 00:03:25.740
Get it off of me! Get it off of me!

00:03:26.533 --> 00:03:27.534
Aah!

00:03:27.617 --> 00:03:29.160
(GRUNTS)

00:03:30.370 --> 00:03:31.371
(GRUNTING)

00:03:32.205 --> 00:03:33.331
(CLUCKS)

00:03:33.655 --> 00:03:35.000
I got you! (SCREAMING)

00:03:40.401 --> 00:03:41.449
I got it!

00:03:48.513 --> 00:03:49.639
(CLUCKING)

00:03:50.196 --> 00:03:51.266
Ha!

00:03:53.059 --> 00:03:54.060
(GASPS) Oh!

00:04:00.936 --> 00:04:02.646
-(GROANS)
- What is wrong with that chicken?

00:04:04.230 --> 00:04:08.100
Hey, that pollo es loco. (CHUCKLES)

00:04:08.688 --> 00:04:10.631
No?
Okay, let's go.

00:04:18.796 --> 00:04:20.213
Are you getting anything?

00:04:20.496 --> 00:04:21.546
No, not yet.

00:04:21.979 --> 00:04:25.341
But, hey, maybe you can find
something with these X-ray goggles.

00:04:27.934 --> 00:04:29.214
Bah.

00:04:33.933 --> 00:04:35.477
How are they working? Tell me! Tell me!

00:04:35.982 --> 00:04:37.522
Aah! Oof!

00:04:37.687 --> 00:04:38.896
What's wrong? Is something wrong?

00:04:39.292 --> 00:04:42.293
That's an image
I'll never get out of my brain. Blech!

00:04:50.605 --> 00:04:52.160
I knew it!

00:04:52.327 --> 00:04:54.120
(GASPS) The serum is in here!

00:04:54.175 --> 00:04:55.371
Ooh, then let's get it.

00:04:55.455 --> 00:04:57.457
(CHUCKLING)

00:04:57.950 --> 00:04:59.918
This is going to be good!

00:05:00.283 --> 00:05:01.336
Ah.

00:05:05.556 --> 00:05:06.616
Ah-ha!

00:05:07.481 --> 00:05:08.504
What?

00:05:08.593 --> 00:05:11.387
(STAMMERING) Salsa?

00:05:11.953 --> 00:05:13.293
Aw, man.

00:05:14.840 --> 00:05:16.001
Oh.

00:05:19.341 --> 00:05:22.607
Somebody's going to die tonight.

00:05:27.998 --> 00:05:29.288
(GASPS) Pollito!

00:05:30.323 --> 00:05:32.735
What did they do to you? Pollito?
Can you hear me?

00:05:32.960 --> 00:05:34.035
(CLUCKS)

00:05:34.100 --> 00:05:37.122
Who would do this
to such a sweet little chicken?

00:05:37.365 --> 00:05:39.184
What? Who's there?

00:05:39.229 --> 00:05:41.000
-(CRUNCHES) Mmm-mmm.
-(GASPS)

00:05:41.126 --> 00:05:43.044
You coming out? Or am I gonna go in?

00:05:48.299 --> 00:05:49.551
Yah!

00:05:50.718 --> 00:05:51.761
Huh?

00:05:53.251 --> 00:05:54.264
Stop!

00:05:54.430 --> 00:05:56.516
(GRUNTS) My eyes!

00:05:57.937 --> 00:05:59.644
Gru, call one of your munchkins!

00:06:00.478 --> 00:06:02.063
We've been spotted! Come get us!

00:06:02.187 --> 00:06:05.108
-Huh? Hey! (CHATTERING IN MINIONESE)
-Ah! (CHATTERING IN MINIONESE)

00:06:15.076 --> 00:06:16.452
Hmm, subtle.

00:06:20.456 --> 00:06:22.500
Over here! Over here!

00:06:22.667 --> 00:06:24.335
Over

00:06:24.559 --> 00:06:25.667
here.

00:06:32.495 --> 00:06:33.789
Hold tight!

00:06:37.473 --> 00:06:38.683
Aah!

00:06:42.770 --> 00:06:44.063
(CHUCKLING)

00:06:44.289 --> 00:06:46.900
I have you now!

00:06:50.486 --> 00:06:51.487
(GROWLS)

00:06:58.912 --> 00:07:00.538
(GRU SCREAMING)

